kerbridge (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=@URGENCY@

  sync.toml: the option cycle_deadline_seconds is now read_deadline_seconds.
  The daemon refuses a file that still names the old option, so rename it
  before you restart. `kbconfig upgrade --dry-run` shows the change, and
  `kbconfig upgrade` makes it. A file that never set the option needs no
  work.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  @DATE@
